  "description": "White, with an orange line starting thin under the cockpit and running aft under the windows, widening behind the wing and sweeping up to the fin, a royal blue hairline under it from the forward windows, widening behind the wing to the tail; the fin white under a blue tip, with orange and blue wing-like spikes and a big orange sweep round a white loop at its foot. 'smartwings' in bold blue italic lower case over the forward windows, an orange scribbled 's' for the dot, then 'com'.",
